@startuml
!include _seq-style.puml
title 3.3.2 ViewProductList

actor "Admin / Manager" as A
boundary "Products UI" as UI <<boundary>>
control "ProductController" as PC <<control>>
control "ProductService" as S <<service>>
entity "ProductRepository" as R <<entity>>

== Product list ==
A -> UI: open Products
activate UI
UI -> PC: GET /api/products
activate PC
PC -> S: getAllProducts()
activate S
S -> R: findAll() (or equivalent query)
activate R
R --> S: List~Product~
deactivate R
S -> S: map → ProductListItemResponse
S --> PC: List~ProductListItemResponse~
deactivate S
PC --> UI: 200 JSON
deactivate PC
UI --> A: product table
deactivate UI

@enduml
